  "published": "2026-09-27T11:54:34.16Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v8.2.0: Adds VoyageContextualizedEmbeddingProvider and GeminiEmbeddingProvider with document/query-aware RAG integration and fluent builder configuration. Voyage preserves whole-document chunk order and boundaries; Gemini returns one vector per text with retrieval prefixes applied only to API input. Adds dimension/count/index/finite-value validation, disabled truncation, sanitized transport errors and cancellation/timeouts. Voyage generic batches observe cancellation while reading inputs and stop above 1,000 texts before any HTTP request. Perplexity contextualized embeddings now opt into the same RAG contract. Perplexity standard/contextualized float and binary methods observe cancellation during input reading and stop at count limits before HTTP, preserving groups, order and public APIs. Existing IEmbeddingProvider implementations and persisted source text remain compatible. Changing embedding models or retrieval formats requires reindexing. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/rag/Mythosia.AI.Rag/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v820",
